      "summary": {
        "unit_id": "hmh07-lua-follow3:136",
        "answer": "Installs frame-create/change image update wrappers once per widget. PC Korea may force an approved basic image; otherwise widget-based calling cards replace the frame with the named CoD widget, while basic images may be remapped in in-game Campaign/Zombies. It stores __backgroundImage/isWidgetBasedCallingCard accordingly and changes the frame. The image updater is deferred to its frame hooks; dynamic CoD lookup, image tables and actual frame creation remain separate providers. For CoD.ChallengesUtility.SetCallingCardForWidget, evaluate the displayed formal inputs and captured values. Its exact paths are 553: if f28_arg0.__backgroundImage and f28_arg0.framedWidget then; 558: if not f28_arg0.__hasUpdateImageCallbacks then; 564: if CoD.isPC and CoD.PCKoreaUtility.ShowKorea15Plus() then; 567: if f28_local3 and f28_local3 ~= @\"hash_0\" then; 574: if not f28_local1 then; 575: if CoD.ChallengesU [excerpt; exact source record identified separately]",
